<title>USA: VIVAX Medical plans secondary offering.</title>
<headline>VIVAX Medical plans secondary offering.</headline>
<dateline>BRISTOL, Conn. 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>VIVAX Medical Corp said it signed a letter of intent with an underwriter for the proposed secondary offering of $6 to $8 million of its common stock.</p>
</text>
